1. INTRODUCTION
  GlobeTrotter is a personalized travel planning application designed to help users plan and organize multi-city trips.
The application allows users to create customized trips, add cities and activities, manage travel dates, estimate expenses, view their itinerary and share their travel plans.
The main purpose of GlobeTrotter is to make travel planning simple, organized and interactive.
2. PROBLEM STATEMENT
Planning a multi-city trip requires managing different types of information such as destinations, travel dates, activities, schedules and expenses.
Managing all this information can be difficult when it is spread across different places.
GlobeTrotter provides a centralized platform where users can organize their complete travel plan, manage their itinerary and keep track of their estimated budget
3. OBJECTIVES
The main objectives of GlobeTrotter are:
•	To create customized multi-city itineraries.
•	To manage travel dates and destinations.
•	To search and explore cities and activities.
•	To estimate trip expenses.
•	To provide a day-wise itinerary.
•	To display trips using calendar and timeline views.
•	To allow users to share their travel plans.
To provide a simple and user-friendly travel planning platform.
