5. TECHNOLOGY USED
The project is divided into three major parts:
Frontend
•	HTML
•	CSS
•	JavaScript
Backend
•	Node.js + Express.js
•	API-based architecture
Database
•	Relational Database
The project uses a structured frontend, backend and database architecture to manage travel-related information.
The project requirements specifically mention the use of a relational database for storing user-specific itineraries, stops, activities and estimated expenses.
