7. EXPECTED OUTCOME
The expected outcome of GlobeTrotter is a user-friendly travel planning application that allows users to:
•	Create personalized trips.
•	Manage multiple destinations.
•	Add travel activities.
•	Organize day-wise itineraries.
•	Estimate trip expenses.
•	View trips through calendar/timeline.
•	Share travel plans with others.
The application aims to provide users with better organization and visibility of their complete journey.
8. CONCLUSION
GlobeTrotter is a travel planning application that combines trip management, destination discovery, activity planning, budgeting, itinerary visualization and trip sharing.
The project uses a structured frontend, backend and database architecture to provide an organized travel planning experience.
It helps users plan their multi-city journeys in a simple, interactive and efficient way.
9. FUTURE SCOPE
GlobeTrotter can be further improved in the future by adding more advanced travel planning features.
Possible future improvements include:
•	Intelligent and personalized travel recommendations.
•	More detailed travel and destination information.
•	Advanced budget and expense tracking.
•	Improved collaboration for shared trip planning.
•	More advanced calendar and itinerary management.
•	Expanded analytics for administrators.
•	Better support for different languages and user preferences.
These improvements can make GlobeTrotter more intelligent, interactive, and useful for travelers.

